    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a feeling. i see it in their eyes when i'm having a bad day. they look so tired, like they're constantly bracing for the next time i fall apart. i've become this huge burden they're forced to carry. it feels so selfish to keep holding onto them when i know i'm just making their lives harder every single day.",
